 opinion about the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.32391797317224386, "w": 0.47017046721544176, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "value of reintroducing elms to Britain", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3427554330498847, "w": 0.3820723122852679, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "16 reference to how Dutch elm disease was", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.376425548005074, "w": 0.44813154935812716, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "brought into Britain", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.39541136611946004, "w": 0.20327768688940623, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "17 a description of the conditions that have", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4238900367089503, "w": 0.44449596323373136, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "enabled a location in Britain to escape Dutch elm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44272753430798373, "w": 0.5006837389169243, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "disease", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4615649941856246, "w": 0.08268709291826311, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "18 reference to the stage at which young elms", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.49481485510685036, "w": 0.4734410132418155, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "become vulnerable to Dutch elm disease", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5136523527058837, "w": 0.41738103491354017, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 19-23", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5446525852205472, "w": 0.17645123815798336, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Look at the following statements (Questions 1 23) and the list of people below. Match", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.573576255077488, "w": 0.8259249570651125, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "each statement with the correct person, A, B, or C.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5922653944397762, "w": 0.5024445281048068, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "NB You may use any letter more than once.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6498160931229526, "w": 0.42826598110280556, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "19.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6787768431087317, "w": 0.037443343428965534, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "If a tree gets infected with Dutch elm disease, the damage rapidly becomes", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.6787768431087317, "w": 0.7700414369979546, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "visible.", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.6974659824710198, "w": 0.07502733827893206, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "20 It may be better to wait and see if the mature elms that have survived", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7263896900493532, "w": 0.8257577388654568, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "continue to flourish.", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.7450788294116414, "w": 0.20791385248484093, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "21.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.773854216474622, "w": 0.037040189679366536, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "There must be an explanation for the survival of some mature elms.", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.773854216474622, "w": 0.6877398379059976, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "22 We need to be aware that insects carrying Dutch elm disease are not very", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8027778486101704, "w": 0.82606285312798, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "far away.", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.8216153839305963, "w": 0.097603435631707, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "23 You understand the effect Dutch elm disease has had when you see", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8505390160661446, "w": 0.8261063237083932, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "evidence of how prominent the tree once was.", "x": 0.1635154212396641, "y": 0.86925290066192, "w": 0.4701929586271827, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}